    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90376.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Thanks, Cecilia. I talked to the congressman on Zoom Monday afternoon. He was in his office at the Capitol. I started by asking him about another Zoom call he'd been on on Saturday, when he and several other House members and senators spoke with the Ukrainian president, Volodymyr Zelensky.",
