        "text": "The speaker believes that fluctuations in foreign oil supplies directly influence domestic fuel prices.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience shares concern over energy costs and their local economic impact.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Changes in Russian oil exports will have measurable consequences for US consumers.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The Bay Area population is affected by national trends in gasoline pricing.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
